# Reproducible public release output: intentionally tracked, so that every
# consumer can clone the compiled .olean libraries and verify them directly,
# without a GitHub account. The build is byte-reproducible, so any drift here
# is a real change and must show up as a diff.

# The disclosure-bounded Successor certificate payload is intentionally tracked.
